msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Upgrade your Quarkiverse extensions to versions supporting Quarkus 3 (when "
"they are available)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Replace more deprecated classes and annotations"
msgstr ""

msgid "Replace some deprecated configuration properties with the new ones"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you encounter issues with this version or the upgrade, please open issues "
"in https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[our tracker]!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Trying out Quarkus 3"
msgstr ""

